    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Berried Delight</h2><p>A precision sword built around rapid draw cuts, ranged slashes, counters, and sudden repositioning.</p><p><strong>Judgement Cut:</strong> Ranged slash, 2d8 force, 30/90.</p><p><strong>Rapid Draw:</strong> Make two 1d8 slashing attacks; the second is launched automatically.</p><p><strong>Sheathe Counter:</strong> Reaction when a creature misses you in melee; make a 1d10 slashing attack.</p><p><strong>Blink Slash:</strong> Bonus Action; reposition/teleport up to 15 ft. Your next Berried Delight attack this turn gains +1d6 slashing.</p><p><strong>Perfect Cut:</strong> 2d10 slashing. Blink Slash can add its +1d6 bonus.</p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
    },
